{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15557,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-beta-watchos-26-6-tvos-26-6-visionos-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le seconde beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito agli sviluppatori la seconda tornata di beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6. Le nuove versioni arrivano tre settimane dopo la prima beta e sono disponibili tramite le Impostazioni dei dispositivi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15546,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-2-ios-26-6-e-versioni-per-ipados-macos-tvos-watchos-26\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 2 di iOS 26.6 e le versioni per iOS, iPadOS, macOS, tvOS e watchOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibile la seconda beta di iOS 26.6, insieme alle beta 2 di iPadOS 26.6, macOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e watchOS 26.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-26.6-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15512,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-taglia-frequenze-audio-keynote-wwdc-per-evitare-attivazioni-siri\",\"title\":\"Apple taglia frequenze audio nel keynote WWDC per evitare attivazioni di Siri\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel keynote WWDC 2026 Apple avrebbe modificato l’audio ogni volta che viene pronunciato “Siri”, rimuovendo bande tra 3 kHz e 6 kHz per ridurre le attivazioni accidentali dei dispositivi vicini.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/homepod-top-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"homepod-top\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15501,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"supporto-software-apple-interrompe-16-dispositivi-autunno\",\"title\":\"Supporto software in calo: Apple interrompe l’aggiornamento per 16 dispositivi\",\"excerpt\":\"In autunno Apple terminerà il supporto software per 16 dispositivi tra Apple Watch, iPad, Mac e Apple TV. I tagli più ampi riguardano Apple Watch, mentre macOS 27 sancisce la fine dei Mac Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Top-Half-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Top-Half\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15422,\"date\":\"2026-06-12T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-11T22:04:27+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-aggiungere-telecomando-apple-tv-schermata-home-iphone\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: aggiungere il telecomando Apple TV alla schermata Home dell’iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27 diventa possibile aggiungere il telecomando Apple TV direttamente alla schermata Home dell’iPhone, per un accesso più rapido alle funzioni di controllo.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-TV-Remote-Icon-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-TV-Remote-Icon\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15273,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-manca-una-settimana-placeholder-youtube-keynote-diretta\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026, manca una settimana: placeholder YouTube e keynote in diretta\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dall’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple ha attivato un placeholder su YouTube con promemoria per il keynote del 8 giugno. La diretta sarà disponibile anche su Apple Events e Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15267,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:14:47+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:14:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-nuova-app-siri-dedicata\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: arriva la nuova app Siri dedicata\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 debutta per la prima volta un’app Siri standalone: uno spazio dedicato per conversare, cercare sul web e usare dati personali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Finder-Siri-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Finder-Siri-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15230,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T17:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6 e tvOS 26.6. Arrivano due giorni dopo le beta per sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15156,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-watchos-26-6-tvos-26-6-visionos-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple mette a disposizione degli sviluppatori le prime beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6. Nessuna novità confermata al momento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T16:00:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-siri-riprogettato-accessibilita-ios-27\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026: Siri riprogettato e nuove funzioni di accessibilità in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple conferma WWDC 2026 (8-12 giugno). Attese novità su iOS 27, con un Siri ripensato, funzioni di accessibilità e aggiornamenti per iOS 27 e altri sistemi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15039,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T09:44:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:47:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-didascalie-automatiche-video-personali-iphone\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: didascalie automatiche per i video personali su iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità: iOS 27 può generare automaticamente didascalie per i video personali, con supporto iniziale in inglese.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15019,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T18:30:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:59:44+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuove-funzioni-accessibilita-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple annuncia aggiornamenti accessibilità basati su Apple Intelligence per VoiceOver, Magnifier, Voice Control e Accessibility Reader, con sottotitoli generati e controllo carrozzina su Vision Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15003,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T12:30:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:58:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-sports-mondiali-2026-90-paesi\",\"title\":\"Apple Sports si aggiorna per i Mondiali 2026 e arriva in 90 Paesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple annuncia l’arrivo di Apple Sports in oltre 90 nuovi Paesi e l’introduzione di funzioni dedicate ai Mondiali 2026, tra cui Live Activities e Apple News.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Sports-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Sports-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14974,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T14:30:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:06:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-programma-wwdc-2026-inviti-media\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica il programma di WWDC 2026 e invia inviti ai media\",\"excerpt\":\"WWDC 2026 si terrà dal 8 al 12 giugno. La keynote inizierà alle 10:00 PT (1:00 ET) e sarà disponibile in streaming su Apple.com, Apple TV e YouTube.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/wwdc-apple-park-in-person-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"wwdc-apple-park-in-person\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14908,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T16:30:54+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:57:03+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rallenta-espansione-f1-apple-tv-sky-rinnova-diritti-europa\",\"title\":\"Apple rallenta l’espansione F1 su Apple TV: Sky rinnova i diritti in Europa\",\"excerpt\":\"L’interesse di Apple per estendere lo streaming della Formula 1 oltre gli Stati Uniti potrebbe essersi fermato: Sky ha rinnovato i diritti in UK, Irlanda e Italia fino al 2034/2032.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/f1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"f1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14902,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T14:00:12+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:55:27+00:00\",\"slug\":\"spotify-adottera-tecnologia-hls-apple-video-podcast\",\"title\":\"Spotify adotterà la tecnologia HLS di Apple per i video podcast\",\"excerpt\":\"Spotify ha annunciato l’adozione della tecnologia HTTP Live Streaming (HLS) di Apple per i video podcast, per distribuire i contenuti su Spotify e Apple Podcasts senza modifiche all’assetto dei creator.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/General-Spotify-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-Spotify-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14823,\"date\":\"2026-05-13T13:30:29+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-13T08:14:28+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-camera-piu-personalizzabile-meteo-safari\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: Camera più personalizzabile, novità su Meteo e Safari\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, iOS 27 porterà una Camera con controlli personalizzabili tramite widget, un nuovo pannello Meteo e una start page aggiornata per Safari.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14776,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T12:30:51+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:56:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-ue-pairing-come-airpods-notifiche-wearables-terze-parti\",\"title\":\"iOS 26.5: pairing “come AirPods” e notifiche su wearables di terze parti (UE)\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 26.5, gli utenti iPhone in UE ottengono nuove funzioni per accessori indossabili di terze parti: pairing via prossimità, inoltro notifiche e Live Activities.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/european-union-eu-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"european-union-eu\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14768,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T09:38:15+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:38:15+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-novita-principali\",\"title\":\"iOS 26.5: tutte le novità principali\",\"excerpt\":\"iOS 26.5 introduce crittografia end-to-end per RCS tra iPhone e Android, nuove funzioni per Maps e cambiamenti UE per wearable di terze parti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14661,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T15:35:25+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:35:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"pixel-non-adotteranno-liquid-glass-apple\",\"title\":\"Pixel non adotteranno il design “Liquid Glass” di Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Sameer Samat, presidente Android per Google, smentisce l’adozione del design “Liquid Glass” su Pixel. Restano però voci su effetti di traslucenza in Android 17.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Photos-App-Icon-Liquid-Glass-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Photos-App-Icon-Liquid-Glass\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14401,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:12:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07: